OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after being hit by car
OL,4,Ain Dundee
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being hit
OL,7,Fby a car in Dundee.
OL,9,FThe incident happened at about 10:45 on
OL,10,FFriday morning on East Dock Street.
OL,12,FThe 77-year-old woman was pronounced
OL,13,Fdead at the scene. The driver of the
OL,14,Fsilver Mini Cooper was not injured.
OL,16,FConstable Christopher McElwee said:
OL,17,F"Our thoughts are with the family of
OL,18,Fthe woman who has died at this
OL,19,Fdifficult time."
